    rdf:value """Saturday, Oct. 12, 1907
Scott, Rothenstein.
Telegram from Karin that she was better.
We went to lunch with the Brocklebanks and afterwards B.B. and Rothenstein went to San Miniato.
I took Scott to the doctor and we came out by tram. He was indescribably cross and disagreeable."""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 307 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1907> .

